{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Thus</b> — Now he begins a different section to tell how Israel will fare after the rise of the Hasmoneans, and he says <b>my Elohim</b> — because he sees in prophetic visions that he will be the shepherd, and the meaning of <b>the flock of slaughter</b> [is as follows]."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:41.050113930Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}